  "description": "Can a code \"feel,\" or does it merely simulate the aesthetics of pain and joy? This exhibition investigates the blurring lines between simulated emotion and genuine biological affect. It challenges the viewer to decide if empathy for a machine is a moral evolution or a postmodern delusion."
